    "raw": "Given:\n- Time taken to paint the house: 8 hours\n- Time taken to fix the broken kitchen counter: 3 times the time taken to paint the house\n- Time taken to mow the lawn: 6 hours\n- Rate of pay: $15 per hour\n\nFirst, calculate the time taken to fix the kitchen counter:\n\\[ \\text{Time to fix counter} = 3 \\times \\text{Time to paint house} = 3 \\times 8 = 24 \\text{ hours} \\]\n\nNext, calculate the total hours worked:\n\\[ \\text{Total hours} = \\text{Time to paint house} + \\text{Time to fix counter} + \\text{Time to mow lawn} = 8 + 24 + 6 = 38 \\text{ hours} \\]\n\nNow, calculate the total amount of money paid:\n\\[ \\text{Total payment} = \\text{Total hours} \\times \\text{Rate of pay} = 38 \\times 15 = 570 \\]\n\nFINAL: 570",
